*****************************************************************
* DALYTRAN-REJECT.dat - Reject scenario daily transaction data
* Layout: CVTRA06Y.cpy (DALYTRAN-RECORD, 350 bytes per record)
*
* Records:
*   1: Invalid card number (not in XREF) - expect reject 0100
*   2: Valid card but account not found   - expect reject 0101
*   3: Valid card+acct but overlimit      - expect reject 0102
*   4: Valid card+acct but expired acct   - expect reject 0103
*
* NOTE: The actual .dat file is generated by the test script
*       using the data generation program.
*****************************************************************
